  m_text: "<size=150%><color=#A3FFFE>242</color></size>\nFixed some typos.\nTesting
    new menu style, let me know which you prefer.\nMade skills show exclusivity in
    the popup.\nUpdated skills wiki.\nRedesigned debug menu.\nAdded IAP option to
    skip this requirement. (gotta support the fam ya know)\nLocked more skills. First
    run hides a lot of the first tree.\nAdded the rest of the skill descriptions.\nMassive
    thanks to VashVash for going through and proofreading loads of the skills.\nAvocado
    Meditation has been added.\n\nlocked fragments and purity behind prestige, please
    suggest more skill locks and what could unlock them in discord. EG reality upgrades,
    prestige, or infinity.\n\nFixed issues with fragments.\nAdded music\nSettings
    sliders finally work\nstopped flicker on reality tab\nmade new debug menu accessable
    from the side menu.\n\nFixed the buy max research\nFixed fragments not resetting
    with skill tree\nChanged Offline Time spending.\nAdded spend again button\n\nbought
    research tab up to standard.\nseparated buy x settings for bots and research.\nfixed
    research not working when you're not on the tab, thanks Latimer!\nslightly nerfed
    purity line. Too op okay?\nfixed sidebar IP display.\nfixed displays on bot tab
    should show values now sigh.\n\nAdded more descriptions.\n\nAdjusted speed and
    translation costs and descriptions\n\nspeed 8 now allows you to prestige at a
    IP cost rather than resetting everything.\n\nAdded descriptions up to skill 46.\nFixed
    a bunch of the other descriptions, thanks Vash and Rapid\n\nFrom Translation
    8 you now manually break reality and can earn multiple IP\nFixed a lot of overflow
    issues.\n\nTogglable descriptions for the skill tree allow for a flavoured text
    and a technical one. I have done skills 1-19 so far. Check the milanote to see
    skill ID, I may add a skill ID toggle later.\n\nI capped manual labour to 50x
    AI manager production.\n\nFixed the display of rockets production in reality.\nMade
    railguns show up properly in reality.\n\nBegan the process of updating how bars
    display in reality content.\n\nAdded skill points to each of the translation/speed
    upgrades. \nRaised the cost of many translation/speed upgrades.\n\nThat's up
    to <color=#A3FFFE>16</color> additional skill points.\n\nSkill Tree mostly finalized,
    balance still needs doing.\n- Added color differences for exclusives.\n- Added
    presets.\n- Added a total of <color=#A3FFFE>84</color> new skills\n- Added some
    color differences to indicate if skills are not refundable.\n- Added a feature
    to toggle between description types, this isn't in use yet but as we balance
    skills I will start to use it more and more.\n\n<size=150%><color=#A3FFFE>Skill
    Specific Changes</color></size>\n- Rocket Mania has a new equation: <color=#A3FFFE>Log20(Panels/sec)</color>\n-
    Androids now scales to a maximum of <color=#A3FFFE>200 over 10 minutes.</color>\n-
    Stellar Sacrifices - Full rework - get planets based on <color=#A3FFFE>log10(galaxies)^2</color>
    and changed the other two stellar skills to only give psudo galaxies (these only
    affect the galaxies used in stellar sacrifices)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
