  m_text: 'You head over to your workstation and overlook the data.

    ''<color=#91DD8F>Simulation
    primed, ready to begin consumption</color>''  You hit enter and the machine begins
    to consume realities much like the one you were just in. Gathering data to run
    even more simulations. Whatever this artifact is, you will work out what it does.'
