  m_text: A sudden realization forms in your mind. While you thought all this time
    you were the one running the simulation, you have in fact been the simulation.
    In the distance you hear a few words as time begins to slow... "Shut it down...
    you know what happened last time the simulation became self aware. You're just
    going to have to start over."
