  m_text: 'You blink your eyes open and memories begin to flood back, how long were
    you stuck in there? You look down at your watch; what felt like many lifetimes
    has passed in mere minutes. You sit up and step from the makeshift platform you
    used for the simulator. It''s difficult to stand as you become somewhat faint
    in your mortal form. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 34bc7e54620b8d34d88b7e42acd6b463, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8614727323866032098, guid: 3079981d1e439524fbb88b3a43b4c219, type: 2}
