  m_text: You decide to take advantage of what you have learned. Infinity doesn't
    seem that long after all. Altering a couple of lines in the assembly line logic
    allows you to produce bots at twice the rate. However before long your previous
    experience with this reality slips from your mind as if it were a dream. "There
    has to be a way to remember more" you think to yourself as you set out to find
    the anomaly  once more.
