  m_text: 'As you stare down at your keyboard, the computer whirring in the background,
    an idea suddenly comes to you. You stand up and head over to your workbench...

    You
    begin working and quickly build a bot, it has two arms and hovers. Huh it works...
    You assign it to begin making solar panels and get to work on another.

'
