        improvements. '
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Starting at <color=#A3FFFE>10 million</color> worker bots, <color=#A3FFFE>panel
        lifetime</color> increases by <color=#A3FFFE>10%</color>. This increases
        by <color=#A3FFFE>10%</color> each time you multiply your workers by <color=#A3FFFE>10</color>.
        <br><br> <color=#A3FFFE>lifetime</color> *= <color=#A3FFFE>1</color> + <color=#A3FFFE>0.1</color>
        * <color=#A3FFFE>log10(<color=#91DD8F>Workers / 1e6</color>)
