    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Unlock the full potential of your space empire with Dyson Subsidies.
        Get a big boost in Cash flow before you surround a star and enjoy increased
        Bot production after. Take your game to the next level and conquer the galaxy
        with Dyson Subsidies.
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Before you surround a star you gain <color=#A3FFFE>3x Cash</color>, after
        a star is surrounded this becomes <color=#A3FFFE>2x Bot</color> production.
