      Data: Galactic Paradigm Shift
    - Name: SkillNamePopup
      Entry: 1
      Data: Galactic Paradigm Shift
    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Galactic Paradigm Shift is a significant increase in Planet production
        within a galaxy. The effects of this change impact intergalactic civilizations
        and the galaxy as a whole, presenting both opportunities and challenges.
        The cause of the shift is still unknown.
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: <color=#A3FFFE>Planets</color> produce <color=#A3FFFE>1.5x</color> as
        much before you <color=#A3FFFE>Engulf a Galaxy</color>. They produce  <color=#A3FFFE>3x</color>
        as much afterwards.
