    - Name: SkillNamePopup
      Entry: 1
      Data: Worthy Sacrifice
    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Worthy Sacrifice is a legendary trade-off, balancing panel longevity
        for efficient assembly. It requires bold leadership and a deep understanding
        of organizational values. A symbol of determination and strategic thinking,
        it is remembered as a tale of calculated risk-taking.
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: <color=#A3FFFE>Panel Lifetime</color> will be reduced by <color=#A3FFFE>50%</color>,
        but <color=#A3FFFE>Assembly Lines</color> will be <color=#A3FFFE>5x</color>
        as effective.
