    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Shoulders of Precursors is a powerful artifact with the ability to
        multiply wealth and knowledge. It negates the effects of other wealth multipliers
        and also affects cash. This mysterious relic from a lost civilization is
        highly valuable and sought after. Its true potential remains unknown.
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Disable <color=#A3FFFE>Cash Multipliers</color>, <color=#A3FFFE>Science
        Multipliers</color> additionally affect <color=#A3FFFE>Cash</color>. <br><br>Mutually
        exclusive with <color=#A3FFFE>Shoulders of the Enlightened</color>.
