    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: The "Shoulders of the Revolution" is a phrase that refers to a powerful
        financial system that harnesses the latest advancements in science to dramatically
        increase wealth. It is said to be built upon the innovations and insights
        of previous generations of thinkers, and it represents a new era of prosperity
        and progress for those who use it.
