    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Why spend multiple threads computing multiple things, when you can instead
        use all threads to compute all things, in a parallel fashion. Your Servers
        become much more efficient this way, boosting your Data Centers.
    - Name: SkillTechnicalDescription
      Entry: 1
