    - Name: SkillDescription
      Entry: 1
      Data: Using the same old server line-up seriously dampers with your progress.
        By utilizing quantum mechanics, you can now have servers that are simultaneously
        on, off, and both, boosting their efficiency in ways you don't quite understand.
